# Airwallex sandbox credentials for ATTEST.
#
# SCOPED, NOT ADMIN. The key this file expects is a scoped key limited to
# Payments (create, read) and Beneficiaries (create, read) — the only two
# things src/rails/payment.py calls. An admin key would work but contradicts
# the project: ATTEST's thesis is that authority should be bounded by what you
# can justify, and that applies to the credential as much as to the payment.
#
# WAS THIS FILE COMMITTED? It must not be. .gitignore lists .env; verify with
#   git check-ignore -v .env
#
# The API key is shown ONCE when the scoped key is created. If it is lost,
# mint a new key rather than trying to recover this one.
#
# AWX_CLIENT_ID is the identifier shown in the dashboard's Client ID column.
# AWX_API_KEY is the secret shown once at creation.

AWX_CLIENT_ID=
AWX_API_KEY=

# Leave unset to use the default sandbox host
# (https://api.sandbox.airwallex.com, per Airwallex's docs). Set this only if
# the first authenticated call returns an auth error and the host needs
# correcting.
# AWX_BASE_URL=
